<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/20/eng@/~cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 15 the following section: “Power to amend Schedules 15a. The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, amend the Schedules to this Act.”. New Schedules"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/20/eng@> .
